              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " You will know them by their fruits. Are grapes gathered from thorns, or figs from thistles? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.7.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.7.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 7:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "So, every sound tree bears good fruit, but the bad tree bears evil fruit. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.7.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.7.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 7:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A sound tree cannot bear evil fruit, nor can a bad tree bear good fruit. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.7.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.7.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 7:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Every tree that does not bear good fruit is cut down and thrown into the fire. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.7.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.7.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 7:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Thus you will know them by their fruits.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.7.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.7.20"
            ]
          }
        }
